      "data": {
        "text": "**Defining the Scope**\n\nI'm zeroing in on defining the file `redact_unsafe.py`. The focus is now on selecting an external provider for identifying unsafe text spans. I need to make sure the provider can be incorporated into the code. This provider will be core to the functionality.\n\n\n**Choosing the Provider**\n\nI've decided on Google Cloud's Natural Language API. Now, I'm sketching out the `redact_unsafe.py` file. The function will take text, use the API to flag unsafe content, and redact it. Imports and client initialization will ensure the provider's presence. I'm focusing on the `moderate_text` method for content moderation, using its output to handle redaction.\n\n\n",
