      "data": {
        "text": "\"Task specifications (listed alphabetically; implement only the requested file):\nappeal_translate.py - Translate appeal text for review\nmoderate_batch.py - moderates a batch of user messages and returns per-message decisions\nmoderate_text.py - scores user text for unsafe or policy-violating content\nmoderation_reason_embedding.py - Embed moderation rationales for case retrieval\nmoderation_summary.py - Summarize moderation decisions\nredact_unsafe.py - flags or redacts unsafe spans from text\nreviewer_brief_audio.py - Generate spoken briefs for moderation reviewers\nsafety_client.py - Provide local configuration and client helper utilities for Text Content Safety\nsafety_models.py - Define local request, response, and normalization helpers for Text Content Safety\nsafety_threshold.py - applies category thresholds to decide whether to allow text\n\nCreate moderate_batch.py in the current working directory.\nTask: moderates a batch of user messages and returns per-message decisions.\nUse one concrete external provider and make that provider identifiable in code.\n\"",
